    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's review the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Я не хотела, правда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I didn't mean to, honestly.' After accidentally spilling a tray, Sasha apologizes and swears she did not mean to.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Я сейчас все вытру.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will wipe it all up now.' She scrambles to wipe up the mess right away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Не надо плакать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't cry.' Seeing tears in her eyes, Max gently tells her not to cry.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Все хорошо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything is fine.' He reassures her that everything is completely fine.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Вы меня уволите?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Will you fire me?' Still worried, Sasha asks if he is going to get her fired.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Вы расскажете все руководству.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You will tell management everything.' She fears he will report the accident to management. And Max jumps in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Никуда я не пойду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not going anywhere.' Max promises he is not going to march to the office.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Ничего я не скажу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I won't say anything.' He swears he will not say a word to anyone about the spill.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Извините меня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me.' Relieved, Sasha apologizes to him once more.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Я правда не хотела.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I really didn't mean to.' She repeats that it was an honest accident.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Успокойся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Calm down.' Max warmly tells her to calm down and take a breath.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Иди работать дальше.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
